<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - York Int'l downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - York Int'l downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter lowered its recommendation on York International Corp to neutral from buy, according to a Dean Witter source.</p>
<p>-- Shares were unchanged at 50-5/8 in early New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
</text>
